<title>ARGENTINA: TABLE-ALPARGATAS POSTS $46.4 MLN H1 LOSS.</title>
<headline>TABLE-ALPARGATAS POSTS $46.4 MLN H1 LOSS.</headline>
<dateline>BUENOS AIRES 1997-08-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>Period ended June 30.</p>
<p>Net loss 46.4 million</p>
<p>Note: The textile and footwear company said the net loss came after an unspecified $40.6 million extraordinary loss. It did say it took a $7.9 million charge against a financial and operating restructuring of the company. EPS was unavailable. It said net worth was $214.4 million.</p>
<p>((Buenos Aires newsroom, 541 318-0618))</p>
